How they were made
------------------
The banners, icons and scenes are drawn from plain shapes and text by make_art.py.
The terminal scenes show text that the brain command printed on a made-up folder.

The brain in the hero, and the pictures behind the chat and private scenes, are images
generated with OpenAI Codex's image tool from the prompts saved in
docs/media/readme/source/ (hero-prompt.txt and scenes-prompt.txt). The legal status of
machine-generated images differs between countries; the licence above covers
whatever rights the contributors hold in it.
